# NablaMimic on NablaEngine with absolute actions, the recipe of the reported comparisons with SHAC, PPO and
# SuperMimic (their action space: joint setpoints = the default pose plus the scaled action), 3 h of training as
# reported. The recommended configs/ours.args is this recipe with residual actions.
@../base/ours.args
--physics engine
--hours 3
